{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "math is hard",
    "steam_appid": 3739920,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f5f9ae3fe78bf009fa7926e075ea1292.webp?t=1749311772\" width=240 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong>\u00a0makes you put to the test your math skills and logical thinking, pushing blocks around the grid solving puzzles. Simple addition and subtraction won't always do the trick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/40df5caaf1db58eee5d385063ebe5294.webp?t=1749311772\" width=240 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has planned over 50 levels. Going through locked doors or sliding on ice and using different combinations of operations (+, \u2013, \u00d7, \u00f7) you must reach the target value. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d88880114df960c0ea0aff19d57d7bf4.webp?t=1749311772\" width=384 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong> challenges both your head for numbers and your eye for strategy. Ready to prove that, with the right moves, math really isn\u2019t so hard after all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was originally created for and won the MiniJam 183: Calculations.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/f5f9ae3fe78bf009fa7926e075ea1292.webp?t=1749311772\" width=240 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong>\u00a0makes you put to the test your math skills and logical thinking, pushing blocks around the grid solving puzzles. Simple addition and subtraction won't always do the trick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/40df5caaf1db58eee5d385063ebe5294.webp?t=1749311772\" width=240 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has planned over 50 levels. Going through locked doors or sliding on ice and using different combinations of operations (+, \u2013, \u00d7, \u00f7) you must reach the target value. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739920/extras/d88880114df960c0ea0aff19d57d7bf4.webp?t=1749311772\" width=384 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>math is hard</strong> challenges both your head for numbers and your eye for strategy. Ready to prove that, with the right moves, math really isn\u2019t so hard after all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was originally created for and won the MiniJam 183: Calculations.</p>",
    "short_description": "math is hard challenges both your head for numbers and your eye for strategy. Solving 50+ handcrafted puzzles, going through locked doors or sliding on ice, are you ready to prove that, with the right moves, math really isn\u2019t so hard after all?",
